            "type": "text",
            "text": " edged baby blanket is 75 x 90 cm. The main fabric is plain treble rows. The final border round adds a picot every four stitches around the perimeter for a decorative edge."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK cotton shows the picot loops clearly without them becoming too floppy. The blanket body is straightforward; the picot edge is the single technique that needs practising. Total yardage is around 360 g."
          }
        ]
      },
