          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "How to work a picot"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "After working a dc, ch 3, then sl st back into the dc just made. A small loop (picot) stands up from the edge."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
