      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "16 tr x 8 rows = 10 x 10 cm in DK cotton with a 4 mm hook. Work the main blanket body first, then add the picot border."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
